  {
   "id": "sec1-9",
   "section": "Anti-imperialism and pan-Islamism",
   "text": "According to Alavi, Ayatollah Khomeini and the Islamic Revolution in Iran strongly influenced the ideology of PIJ's founder Fathi Shaqaqi and, by extension, that of Palestinian Islamic Jihad.",
   "words": 29,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    29
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1121296687,
   "revisions": [
