  {
   "id": "sec1-11",
   "section": "Anti-imperialism and pan-Islamism",
   "text": "Accordingly, Shaqaqi viewed the Iranian revolution as a breakthrough in the fight for decolonization and, according to Alavi, pro-Iranian sentiment is still central to PIJ today.",
